    "ch2h": "🍽️ Analyse restaurant dishes",
    "ch2p": "Describe a restaurant dish and the AI assesses each ingredient, explains the FODMAP risks, and suggests how to order it low-FODMAP.",
    "ch3h": "📅 Weekly meal plans",
    "ch3p": "Ask for a full low-FODMAP weekly menu with breakfast, lunch, dinner, and snacks – the AI creates a varied and balanced plan with recipes.",
    "ch4h": "🛒 Shopping lists",
    "ch4p": "After your meal plan, ask for a shopping list. The AI generates one based on the menu so you always have the right ingredients at home.",
    "ch5h": "❓ FODMAP questions",
    "ch5p": "Ask what FODMAP is, which types exist (fructans, galactans, polyols, fructose, lactose), how the diet works, or anything else related to FODMAP.",
    "ch6h": "🧘 Stress management",
    "ch6p": "Stress can worsen IBS symptoms. Ask the AI for relaxation techniques, breathing exercises, and practical tips for long-term stress management.",
    "man_cam_tag": "📸 AI Camera",
    "man_cam_title": "Everything you can photograph",
    "man_cam_sub": "Point the camera, take a photo – and get an instant FODMAP analysis with a score from 0 to 100.",
    "cam1h": "🥕 Single food item",
    "cam1p": "Photograph a fruit, vegetable, or ingredient to instantly find out if it's low or high FODMAP – with portion advice and safe alternatives.",
    "cam2h": "🍲 Meals and dishes",
    "cam2p": "Photo an entire meal and the AI identifies all ingredients, assesses each one, and checks for FODMAP stacking – where several moderate items together exceed the safe limit.",
    "cam3h": "📋 Restaurant menus",
    "cam3p": "Photo a menu in any language and get suggestions for safe dishes, with specific tips on what to ask the waiter to change or leave out.",
    "cam4h": "🧊 Fridge contents",
    "cam4p": "Photo your fridge and the AI lists all recognisable ingredients with FODMAP status, then creates two low-FODMAP recipe suggestions based on what you have.",
    "cam5h": "🥤 Drinks",
    "cam5p": "Photograph a drink – juice, smoothie, or soft drink – and get a full FODMAP assessment including information about sweeteners and safe portion sizes.",
    "cam6h": "🔢 FODMAP score 0–100",
    "cam6p": "모든 카메라 분석은 0~100의 FODMAP 점수를 제공합니다. 초록색(80–100)은 안전, 노란색(55–79)은 중간 주의, 빨간색(55 미만)은 높은 FODMAP 함량을 의미합니다. 한눈에 판단할 수 있습니다.",
    "man_bc_tag": "🏷️ Barcode Scanner",
    "man_bc_title": "Instant product checks in the store",
    "man_bc_sub": "Point the camera at any product's barcode and get a full FODMAP assessment in seconds.",
    "bc1h": "🌍 Over 4.4 million products",
    "bc1p": "바코드 스캐너는 Open Food Facts를 활용합니다 – 전 세계 국가에서 440만개 이상의 제품이 포함된 세계에서 가장 큰 개방형 식품 데이터베이스 중 하나입니다. 당신이 집에 있든 해외 여행 중이든 상관없이 이 제품이 이미 데이터베이스에 있을 가능성이 높습니다.",
    "bc2h": "📊 AI-powered ingredient analysis",
    "bc2p": "When you scan a barcode, the app fetches the full ingredient list and analyses every ingredient with advanced AI – giving you a complete, reliable FODMAP verdict.",
    "bc3h": "✅ Safe shopping made easy",
    "bc3p": "Use the scanner before putting anything in your trolley. It works with packaged products from any country – perfect when travelling or shopping at international stores.",
